  "text": "### 5.2 Audit Prioritization  \n**Risk-Based Prioritization:**\n- **High Risk (Annual Audit):** AML/KYC, Payment Processing, Fraud Detection, Technology Controls\n- **Medium Risk (Biennial Audit):** Complaint Handling, Account Opening, Operational Risk, Compliance\n- **Low Risk (Triennial Audit):** Facilities, Payroll, Travel & Expenses  \n**2026 Audit Plan (Illustrative):**\n1. Account Opening & KYC (Regulatory focus)\n2. Payment Processing (Critical process)\n3. Fraud Detection (High-risk)\n4. IT General Controls (Annual standard)\n5. Operational Risk (Annual standard)\n6. Compliance Controls (Annual standard)  \n---",
